---
import Page from "@/layouts/Page.astro";
import { SITE } from "@/config";
---

<Page
  title={`Privacy | ${SITE.title}`}
  description="How Rudy Galan’s site and the Risk On shop handle your information."
>
  <h1 class="page-title">Privacy</h1>
  <div class="prose-block essay-body">
    <p>
      For shop orders, we collect only the information necessary to process your
      order: name, shipping address, email, and payment details.
    </p>
    <p>
      Payments are processed securely through Stripe. We do not store your
      credit card information on our servers.
    </p>
    <p>
      Order and shipping information may be shared with our fulfillment partner,
      Printful, solely to produce and ship your order.
    </p>
    <p>
      If you sign up for email updates, your address is stored by our email
      provider (beehiiv) so we can send you what you signed up for. You can
      unsubscribe at any time from the link in any email.
    </p>
    <p>
      We do not sell or share your personal information with third parties for
      marketing purposes.
    </p>
    <p>
      If you have questions about your data, contact us at <a
        href="mailto:growingstateofmind@gmail.com"
        >growingstateofmind@gmail.com</a
      >.
    </p>
  </div>
  <p class="after-list">
    <a class="text-link" href="/nonzero#shop">Back to the shop</a>
  </p>
</Page>
